{"title":"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> are constants and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/7/8e7173a88a9333ef56bdf10ee397f414533b8dd8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x + 2)(x + b) = x^2 + cx + 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"223\" height=\"19\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/5/025fdf71f24a34463248d6c1f4bd0a01e7d0024e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ -5\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ -3\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ -1\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 3\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"415\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We first start out by expanding the left side of the equation, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/9/619ffa0f2a40495825035166d4ce22811b3abb3c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x+2)(x+b)=x^{2}+bx+2x+2b=x^2+(2+b)x+2b=x^2+cx+6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"554\" height=\"19\" />. We know the constant \nterms have to be equal so we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/2/1d22a9b02d9210440bb29540b194dd8cabd8bca6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2b=6$\" width=\"49\" height=\"12\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/6/626beed3a7eee094ce4b6cf79a49d81669f72d99.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=3$\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" />. Plugging <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/6/626beed3a7eee094ce4b6cf79a49d81669f72d99.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=3$\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" /> back in yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/2/7b2ff4f081691e0e3f830921352f97692e55070b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2+(2+3)x+6=x^2+cx+6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"249\" height=\"19\" />. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/8/bb84160855a06ea9179b8aad4c45bfd62767cfb3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=5 \\implies \\boxed{\\text{E}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"113\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME\" title=\"1988 AHSME\">1988 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1988 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1988\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1988 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\